# NOTE: data/ and layoutlm_finetuned/ are intentionally excluded.
# data/ (626 receipt images, ~350MB) is fetched fresh from the source
# repo, not versioned here. layoutlm_finetuned/ (the fine-tuned model)
# is a build artifact, not source — regenerate via train_layoutlm.py.
# The *.jsonl files (labeled_lines, layoutlm_train/test) are derived
# from data/ by prepare_labels.py/prepare_layoutlm_data.py — cheap to
# regenerate, no reason to version large derived files either.
